id=tb322fc_identity
name=Y700 Identity Restore (TB322FC)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=ZCode
description=Restore the real Lenovo TB322FC device identity (standard ro.product.* only) so games with per-model graphics profiles (e.g. Delta Force) use the Y700 4th Gen profile. Toggle off to revert. ColorOS private identity (project 25928) is untouched.
